{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-walking","title":"树遍历解释器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/tree-walking","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"树遍历解释器\">树遍历解释器</h1><p>写一个能跑的解释器，最短的路径是：把源码解析成抽象语法树，然后写一个递归函数沿着这棵树走，每遇到一个节点就当场算出它的值。《Crafting Interpreters》里的 jlox、Ruby MRI 1.8、早期的 PHP，都是这么干的。它简单到可以在一个下午里写完，却也因为简单而暴露出一切性能问题的源头——理解它的优雅与缺陷，是理解为什么后续要发明字节码的最佳起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>树遍历解释器的全部秘密在于：AST 的结构本身就编码了求值顺序。一个 <code>(1 + 2) * 3</code> 的表达式，其语法树的形状——乘法在上、加法在左子树——天然规定了&quot;先算加法、再算乘法&quot;。求值就是对这棵树做一次后序遍历：先求子节点的值，再用它们算父节点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  MUL[&quot;乘法节点 *&quot;] --&gt; ADD[&quot;加法节点 +&quot;]&#10;  MUL --&gt; LIT3[&quot;字面量 3&quot;]&#10;  ADD --&gt; LIT1[&quot;字面量 1&quot;]&#10;  ADD --&gt; LIT2[&quot;字面量 2&quot;]&#10;  EVAL[&quot;eval(node)&quot;] -.递归.-&gt; MUL&#10;  EVAL -.递归.-&gt; ADD\">flowchart TD\n  MUL[\"乘法节点 *\"] --&gt; ADD[\"加法节点 +\"]\n  MUL --&gt; LIT3[\"字面量 3\"]\n  ADD --&gt; LIT1[\"字面量 1\"]\n  ADD --&gt; LIT2[\"字面量 2\"]\n  EVAL[\"eval(node)\"] -.递归.-&gt; MUL\n  EVAL -.递归.-&gt; ADD</pre><p>这种&quot;结构即顺序&quot;的特性让实现极为直接，但也意味着每次执行都要重新走一遍指针密布的树——这正是它与 <a href=\"bytecode-vm\">字节码与虚拟机</a> 的根本分歧点，后者把树压平成线性指令流，消除了反复的指针追逐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"visitor-模式与求值分派\">Visitor 模式与求值分派</h2><p>实现树遍历的主流写法是 Visitor 模式：为每种 AST 节点类型定义一个 <code>visit</code> 方法，求值器对节点调用对应的访问者。这把&quot;节点的数据结构&quot;和&quot;对节点的操作&quot;解耦——同一棵 AST 既能被求值器遍历，也能被类型检查器、漂亮打印器复用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class Interpreter:&#10;    def eval(self, node, env):&#10;        return node.accept(self, env)   # 双重分派&#10;&#10;    def visit_binary(self, node, env):&#10;        left = self.eval(node.left, env)&#10;        right = self.eval(node.right, env)&#10;        if node.op == &#39;+&#39;:&#10;            return left + right&#10;        if node.op == &#39;*&#39;:&#10;            return left * right&#10;&#10;    def visit_literal(self, node, env):&#10;        return node.value\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Interpreter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> eval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node, env):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.accept(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, env)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 双重分派</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> visit_binary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node, env):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.eval(node.left, env)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.eval(node.right, env)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.op </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '+'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.op </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> visit_literal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, node, env):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.value</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里藏着第一笔隐性开销：<code>node.accept(self)</code> 是一次虚方法调用（双重分派），CPU 难以预测它跳向哪个 <code>visit</code>。一棵有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点的表达式树，每次求值要付出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次这种难预测的间接调用。下表对比几种节点的求值代价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>AST 节点类型</th>\n<th>子节点遍历</th>\n<th>间接分派次数</th>\n<th>主要开销来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字面量</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>单次访问者跳转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二元运算</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>左右子树递归 + 自身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量引用</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>1 + 环境查找</td>\n<td>作用域链遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数调用</td>\n<td>n 个实参</td>\n<td>n + 2</td>\n<td>新建环境帧 + 体求值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>if 语句</td>\n<td>条件 + 分支</td>\n<td>2 或 3</td>\n<td>条件求值后选择子树</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"环境与作用域链\">环境与作用域链</h2><p>变量是树遍历解释器里第二个开销大户。每个作用域对应一个环境（通常是哈希表加上指向父环境的指针），查找一个变量要沿着这条链从内到外逐层探查。一个深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的嵌套作用域里查找最外层变量，最坏要做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 次哈希表查找。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class Environment:&#10;    def __init__(self, parent=None):&#10;        self.vars = {}&#10;        self.parent = parent&#10;&#10;    def get(self, name):&#10;        env = self&#10;        while env is not None:        # 沿作用域链向上&#10;            if name in env.vars:&#10;                return env.vars[name]&#10;            env = env.parent&#10;        raise NameError(name)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.vars </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.parent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, name):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 沿作用域链向上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.vars:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.vars[name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.parent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NameError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>成熟的树遍历解释器会做&quot;变量解析&quot;优化：在求值前做一次静态遍历，把每个变量引用预先标注成&quot;向上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层、第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个槽位&quot;，把运行时的哈希查找降成数组索引。这其实已经是在向字节码 VM 的局部变量槽位思想靠拢了——后者把这种槽位化做到了极致，详见 <a href=\"../vm-design/runtime-data-structures\">运行时数据结构</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控制流与中断求值\">控制流与中断求值</h2><p>树遍历对顺序、分支、循环的处理都很自然：if 节点求值条件后选择一棵子树继续递归，while 节点在条件成立时反复递归体子树。麻烦在于&quot;非局部跳出&quot;：<code>return</code>、<code>break</code>、异常都要中断当前正在进行的递归。</p>\n<p>宿主语言若支持异常，最常见的技巧是用宿主异常来实现 <code>return</code>——抛出一个携带返回值的特殊异常，在函数调用的访问者里捕获。这种写法直观，但宿主异常的抛出与栈展开代价不菲。更深层的问题是：递归求值把解释器的状态绑死在宿主语言的调用栈上，想实现协程、生成器这种&quot;挂起再恢复&quot;的特性就极其困难——你无法把宿主的 C 栈&quot;存下来待会儿接着跑&quot;。这正是 <a href=\"interpretation-models\">解释执行模型</a> 里小步语义优势的具体体现，也是字节码 VM 因为状态被显式物化而能轻松支持生成器的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能现实与适用边界\">性能现实与适用边界</h2><p>树遍历解释器到底有多慢？经验数字是：相对等价的字节码解释器通常慢 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>，相对原生码可慢 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>。慢的根源不是单一的，而是叠加效应——反复的指针追逐破坏缓存局部性、海量难预测的间接分派打乱流水线、环境链查找的隐性成本。</p>\n<p>但它并非一无是处。对只跑一遍的配置脚本、模板渲染、领域专用小语言（DSL），树遍历的&quot;零编译启动&quot;和实现简单往往压倒性能劣势。许多生产系统的策略是：用树遍历跑冷代码，对识别出的热点再降级成字节码或直接 JIT——这与 <a href=\"../jit/jit-principles\">JIT 编译原理</a> 的分层思想一脉相承，只是把光谱的起点设在了最左端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>树遍历的核心是&quot;AST 结构即求值顺序&quot;，对树做后序遍历当场算值，实现极简。</li>\n<li>Visitor 模式解耦数据与操作，但每个节点付出难预测的间接分派成本。</li>\n<li>环境用哈希表加父指针实现作用域链，变量查找最坏与嵌套深度成正比，可用静态解析优化为槽位索引。</li>\n<li>非局部控制流（return/异常/协程）受困于状态绑死宿主调用栈，是树遍历最大的结构性短板。</li>\n<li>相对字节码慢 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>，但在一次性脚本与 DSL 场景下&quot;零编译启动&quot;仍有价值。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"bytecode-vm\">字节码与虚拟机</a> 看树如何被压平成线性指令流，从而消除指针追逐与状态绑定的双重枷锁。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"树遍历解释器","id":"树遍历解释器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Visitor 模式与求值分派","id":"visitor-模式与求值分派"},{"level":2,"text":"环境与作用域链","id":"环境与作用域链"},{"level":2,"text":"控制流与中断求值","id":"控制流与中断求值"},{"level":2,"text":"性能现实与适用边界","id":"性能现实与适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"解释执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/interpretation-models"},"next":{"title":"字节码与虚拟机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/bytecode-vm"}}